From: Salty <99386653+PjSalty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:12:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] cache: add EF second level cache packages

Intent: bring EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor and its StackExchange.Redis
provider into the publish output so the provider can cache query results in
Valkey or Redis.
Drop when: upstream ships a second level cache of its own.
Ceiling: pinned at 5.5.1 because the plugin's AsyncKeyedLock must equal the
server's (8.0.2 at 12.1): the host loads its own copy into the default load
context first and a higher plugin reference fails to bind. 5.3.11 through
5.5.1 reference exactly 8.0.2; 5.5.2 needs 8.1.2. Bump only together with the
server's AsyncKeyedLock pin. The transitive MessagePack 3.1.8 is above every
MessagePack advisory's fixed version (3.1.7), so no direct MessagePack pin.
---
 .../Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj                  | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
index 9413815..d1e1ec3 100644
--- a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
+++ b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
@@ -37,6 +37,21 @@
     </PackageReference>
   </ItemGroup>
 
+  <ItemGroup>
+    <!-- Second level cache: must reach the publish output, so no PrivateAssets.
+         Pinned at 5.5.1 because the plugin's AsyncKeyedLock must EQUAL the
+         server's: the host loads its own AsyncKeyedLock (8.0.2 at 12.1) into
+         the default load context before the plugin, and a higher plugin
+         reference then fails to bind (FileLoadException at cache bootstrap,
+         observed live on the 10.11 host). 5.3.11 through 5.5.1 reference
+         exactly 8.0.2; 5.5.2 moves to 8.1.2. Bump only together with the
+         server's AsyncKeyedLock pin. The Redis provider brings
+         StackExchange.Redis 3.2.1 and MessagePack 3.1.8, above every
+         MessagePack advisory's fixed version, so no direct pin is needed. -->
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor" Version="5.5.1" />
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor.StackExchange.Redis" Version="5.5.1" />
+  </ItemGroup>
+
   <ItemGroup>
     <PackageReference Include="SerilogAnalyzer" Version="0.15.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
     <PackageReference Include="StyleCop.Analyzers" Version="1.2.0-beta.556" PrivateAssets="All" />
